{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000147475","approvedSymbol":"ERLIN2","functionDescriptions":["Component of the ERLIN1/ERLIN2 complex which mediates the endoplasmic reticulum-associated degradation (ERAD) of inositol 1,4,5- trisphosphate receptors (IP3Rs) such as ITPR1 (PubMed:17502376, PubMed:19240031). Promotes sterol-accelerated ERAD of HMGCR probably implicating an AMFR/gp78-containing ubiquitin ligase complex (PubMed:21343306). Involved in regulation of cellular cholesterol homeostasis by regulation the SREBP signaling pathway. May promote ER retention of the SCAP-SREBF complex (PubMed:24217618). {ECO:0000269|PubMed:17502376, ECO:0000269|PubMed:19240031, ECO:0000269|PubMed:21343306, ECO:0000269|PubMed:24217618}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"O94905","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A384ME54","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"E5RHW4","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"E5RJ09","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000335220","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000427847","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000428112","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000429229","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000429621","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000429903","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000473292","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000497100","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000531296","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000531297","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000531298","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000531299","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000531300","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000531301","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000531302","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000531303","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000633442","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000633443","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000653160","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000653161","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000690650","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000690651","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000737804","sou